{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜超級樞紐博覽會一連三日舉行／立法會討論打擊圍標及加強消防安全\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261103.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】第三屆超級樞紐博覽會今日(11月3日)起一連三日在亞洲國際博覽館舉行，來自超過60個國家的主要機場營運機構航空業界出席。同日，立法會保安及經濟發展事務委員會聯席會議討論打擊圍標及加強消防安全。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T01:01:26.858774+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T23:26:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T20:38:17.239118+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T00:59:05.179777+00:00","content_hash":"a65bc1e9aaf195716c8eb9a842419831ca6434226f8b19746939e51b0fdf8fda","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T01:01:26.858774+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}